Third-party data and names
--------------------------
Skald has no third-party runtime dependencies: it uses the Python standard
library. PyYAML (MIT licence) is used if it is already installed, and Pillow (HPND
licence) turns fetched site icons into small PNGs if it is installed; both are optional.

If you add a country database, its own licence applies. DB-IP Lite, for
example, is CC BY 4.0 and needs the credit line "IP geolocation by DB-IP"
(https://db-ip.com); Skald can show that credit beside every country list.

